{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PfQT3b75Zazax7rfaRqLan","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brief: remove instance-wide AI config\n2\t\n3\ttype: feature\n4\tid: adult\n5\tbranch: feature/adult_remove-instance-wide-ai-config\n6\tdate: 2026-10-14\n7\tauthor: Leander Muskalla\n8\t\n9\t## What\n10\t\n11\tRemove the instance-level AI settings, since solyto/api now runs AI on each\n12\tuser's plugin config (`597ce36`, together with `618c1b8` and `cea37f0`):\n13\t\n14\t- `compose.yml`: remove `AI_API_KEY_FILE` and the `ai_api_key` secret from\n15\t  `api`, and the top-level `ai_api_key` secret definition.\n16\t- `setup.sh`: remove `write_empty \"ai_api_key\"`.\n17\t- `.env`: remove the `# AI (library recommendations)` block (`AI_BASE_URL`,\n18\t  `AI_MODEL`).\n19\t- `README.md`: remove `ai_api_key` from the secrets tree and replace the\n20\t  \"AI API Key\" paragraph with a short note that AI recommendations are now\n21\t  configured per user in the app.\n22\t\n23\t## Why\n24\t\n25\t`config/services.php` no longer has an `ai` block, so the secret and env vars\n26\tare dead. Keeping them suggests to self-hosters that they still do something.\n27\t\n28\t## Decisions\n29\t\n30\t- Only remove what the API no longer reads; no new env vars replace it.\n31\t\n32\t## Out of scope\n33\t\n34\t- Documenting the per-user plugin UI in detail.\n35\t\n36\t## Notes\n37\t\n38\t- Existing installs can delete `secrets/ai_api_key` after updating; leaving it\n39\t  in place is harmless.\n40\t- Check whether the API release containing `597ce36` is tagged before\n41\t  shipping this, so `SOLYTO_VERSION` pins don't break.\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c473825c-071f-47b3-b1f1-5a556f577b0a","uuid":"7711b59c-a329-4f2b-9485-7ef07f1ee441","timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:33:55.428Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/adult_remove-instance-wide-ai-config/brief.md","content":"# Brief: remove instance-wide AI config\n\ntype: feature\nid: adult\nbranch: feature/adult_remove-instance-wide-ai-config\ndate: 2026-10-14\nauthor: Leander Muskalla\n\n## What\n\nRemove the instance-level AI settings, since solyto/api now runs AI on each\nuser's plugin config (`597ce36`, together with `618c1b8` and `cea37f0`):\n\n- `compose.yml`: remove `AI_API_KEY_FILE` and the `ai_api_key` secret from\n  `api`, and the top-level `ai_api_key` secret definition.\n- `setup.sh`: remove `write_empty \"ai_api_key\"`.\n- `.env`: remove the `# AI (library recommendations)` block (`AI_BASE_URL`,\n  `AI_MODEL`).\n- `README.md`: remove `ai_api_key` from the secrets tree and replace the\n  \"AI API Key\" paragraph with a short note that AI recommendations are now\n  configured per user in the app.\n\n## Why\n\n`config/services.php` no longer has an `ai` block, so the secret and env vars\nare dead. Keeping them suggests to self-hosters that they still do something.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- Only remove what the API no longer reads; no new env vars replace it.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Documenting the per-user plugin UI in detail.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Existing installs can delete `secrets/ai_api_key` after updating; leaving it\n  in place is harmless.\n- Check whether the API release containing `597ce36` is tagged before\n  shipping this, so `SOLYTO_VERSION` pins don't break.\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PfQT3b75Zazax7rfaRqLan","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
