{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MFc742rszLfGNV4D27BeRX","type":"tool_result","content":"# Implementation: remove instance-wide AI config\n\nid: adult\ndate: 2026-10-14\n\n## Summary\n\nRemoved the instance-level AI configuration that solyto/api no longer reads\n(`compose.yml`, `setup.sh`, `README.md`). The `.env` change (TASK-3) could\n**not** be made in this session — see Known issues.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: `compose.yml` — removed `AI_API_KEY_FILE` env entry and `- ai_api_key`\nfrom the `api` service's `secrets:`, and the top-level `ai_api_key` secret\ndefinition. Pure line deletions; no other `ai_api_key` references remain.\n(`docker compose config` / a YAML parser aren't available in this sandbox, so\nvalidation was by diff/grep only.)\n\nTASK-2: `setup.sh` — removed `write_empty \"ai_api_key\"`. `bash -n` passes.\n\nTASK-3: **not done.** In this worktree `/workspace/.env` is a character device\n(a `/dev/null` mount, apparently sandbox masking of `.env` files), so it can't\nbe read or edited. The committed `HEAD:.env` does contain the\n`# AI (library recommendations)` block (comment lines + `AI_BASE_URL=` +\n`AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini`). I deliberately did not get around the mask (e.g. by\nwriting the blob into the index with git plumbing).\n\nTASK-4: `README.md` — removed `├── ai_api_key` from the secrets tree and\nreplaced the \"AI API Key\" bullet with a short note that music/book AI\nrecommendations are configured per user in the app (plugin settings), plus\nthe note that existing installs can delete `secrets/ai_api_key`.\n\nTASK-5: pre-ship check, not a code change — not verifiable from this repo.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- **TASK-3 still open:** someone with normal access to `.env` should delete the\n  `# AI (library recommendations)` block (4 comment/var lines plus the blank\n  line around it) from `.env` and commit it on this branch before merging.\n- **TASK-5:** before shipping, confirm a tagged solyto/api release /\n  `solyto/api-php` image includes `597ce36`, `618c1b8` and `cea37f0`.\n- Because `.env` is masked, `git status` always shows it as modified and\n  `git add -A` fails on it (\"unsupported file type\"). I staged files by path.\n# Verdict: remove instance-wide AI config\n\nid: adult\nreviewer: reviewer agent\ndate: 2026-10-14\n\n## Review\n\nBase: `main` (`.manigot/manigot.json` not present, so I used the default). Branch verified: `feature/adult_remove-instance-wide-ai-config`.\nReviewed `git diff main...HEAD`. Outside `docs/jobs/…`, only `compose.yml`, `setup.sh` and `README.md` changed. Nothing changed that the tasks didn't ask for.\n\nTASK-1: PASS\nnotes: `compose.yml` removes `AI_API_KEY_FILE` (api env), `- ai_api_key` (api secrets) and the top-level `ai_api_key:` definition. These are pure line deletions, and indentation and the neighbouring entries are intact. `git grep` finds no remaining `ai_api_key` references in compose.\n\nTASK-2: PASS\nnotes: `setup.sh` removes `write_empty \"ai_api_key\"`, and `bash -n setup.sh` passes.\n\nTASK-3: FAIL\nnotes: Not done (implementation.md says so openly, because `.env` is masked in the sandbox). `git show HEAD:.env` lines 68–72 still contain\n`# AI (library recommendations)`, the two comment lines, `AI_BASE_URL=` and `AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini`. The brief explicitly requires removing this block. As a result, the new README note (\"no instance-level secret or `.env` values are needed\") is currently contradicted by the shipped `.env`.\n\nTASK-4: PASS\nnotes: `README.md` removes `├── ai_api_key` from the secrets tree and replaces the \"AI API Key\" bullet with a short per-user note, including the \"existing installs can delete `secrets/ai_api_key`; leaving it in place is harmless\" note. It doesn't go into plugin UI detail, so it stays in scope.\n\nTASK-5: NOT VERIFIABLE (pre-ship check, no code)\nnotes: This repo can't confirm that a tagged solyto/api release / `solyto/api-php` image contains `597ce36`, `618c1b8` and `cea37f0`. A human must confirm this before shipping (the brief's Notes).\n\n## Security\n\nNot run. This change only removes config.\n\n## Overall\n\nNEEDS WORK\n\nMust change before merge:\n1. Remove the `# AI (library recommendations)` block (comment lines plus `AI_BASE_URL=` and `AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini`, and the surrounding extra blank line) from the committed `.env` on this branch. This has to be done by someone with real access to `.env`, since the agent sandbox masks it.\n2. Before shipping, confirm that the solyto/api release containing `597ce36` (+ `618c1b8`, `cea37f0`) is tagged and published as `solyto/api-php`, so `SOLYTO_VERSION` pins don't break.\nd691739 [adult] chore: commit all\ne987912 [adult] verdict: NEEDS WORK — .env AI block not removed (TASK-3)\n2a6ed39 [adult] chore: commit all\na0e4f60 [adult] implementation: add summary\ncc3a1a9 [adult] README: AI recommendations are configured per user\ne86b19a [adult] setup.sh: stop creating ai_api_key secret\n18900ff [adult] compose: remove ai_api_key secret\ne4fe359 [adult] chore: commit all\nerror: .env: unsupported file type\nfatal: cannot hash .env\nerror: .env: unsupported file type\nfatal: cannot hash .env\ncrw-rw-rw- 1 root root 1, 3 Oct  8 09:30 .env","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b94a6b91-d5b4-42e6-a6e7-ce233ad42dcf","uuid":"425a25fe-fce6-4847-97fa-822aa1edc8c1","timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:35:51.268Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Implementation: remove instance-wide AI config\n\nid: adult\ndate: 2026-10-14\n\n## Summary\n\nRemoved the instance-level AI configuration that solyto/api no longer reads\n(`compose.yml`, `setup.sh`, `README.md`). The `.env` change (TASK-3) could\n**not** be made in this session — see Known issues.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: `compose.yml` — removed `AI_API_KEY_FILE` env entry and `- ai_api_key`\nfrom the `api` service's `secrets:`, and the top-level `ai_api_key` secret\ndefinition. Pure line deletions; no other `ai_api_key` references remai